<title>JAPAN: Sanwa posts 106.33 bln yen stock appraisal loss.</title>
<headline>Sanwa posts 106.33 bln yen stock appraisal loss.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanwa Bank Ltd said on Friday that its appraisal loss on securities holdings at the end of March totalled 106.33 billion yen.</p>
</text>
